   "text": "この療法を選ぶ[[OPEN_1]]理由[[CLOSE_1]]とは？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4b6de4bc47e2ad4a3056",
